<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Xác Thực Truy Cập | Client Verification</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f3f4f6; color: #1f2937; margin: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; height: 100vh; }
        .container { background-color: #ffffff; padding: 40px; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); max-width: 450px; width: 90%; text-align: center; border-top: 5px solid #f59e0b; }
        
        h1 { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 10px; color: #111827; }
        h1 span { display: block; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400; color: #6b7280; margin-top: 5px; }
        p { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; color: #4b5563; margin-bottom: 25px; }
        
        .turnstile-widget {
            border: 1px solid #d1d5db; background-color: #fafafa; border-radius: 6px; padding: 12px 15px;
            display: flex; align-items: center; margin: 0 auto 25px; max-width: 280px; text-align: left;
            box-shadow: inset 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.02); cursor: pointer; user-select: none; transition: background-color 0.2s;
        }
        .turnstile-widget:hover { background-color: #f3f4f6; }
        .ts-checkbox { width: 28px; height: 28px; border: 2px solid #9ca3af; border-radius: 4px; background: #fff; margin-right: 15px; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; transition: all 0.2s; }
        .ts-checkbox.checked { border-color: #10b981; }
        .ts-checkbox.checked::after { content: '\2714'; color: #10b981; font-weight: bold; font-size: 20px; }
        .ts-spinner { width: 24px; height: 24px; border: 3px solid #e5e7eb; border-top-color: #f59e0b; border-radius: 50%; animation: spin 1s linear infinite; display: none; margin-right: 17px; }
        .ts-text { flex-grow: 1; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; color: #374151; }
        .ts-logo { font-size: 10px; color: #9ca3af; text-align: right; line-height: 1.2; margin-left: 10px; }
        .ts-logo strong { color: #f59e0b; font-size: 12px; }
        @keyframes spin { 0% { transform: rotate(0deg); } 100% { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
        
        .ray-id { font-size: 11px; color: #9ca3af; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Xác minh bảo mật<span>Security Check</span></h1>
        <p>Hệ thống cần xác nhận bạn là người thật để tiếp tục truy cập. Vui lòng bấm vào ô bên dưới.</p>
        
        <div class="turnstile-widget" id="verify-btn">
            <div class="ts-checkbox" id="ts-box"></div>
            <div class="ts-spinner" id="ts-spin"></div>
            <div class="ts-text">Verify you are human</div>
            <div class="ts-logo"><strong>HOFA</strong><br>Security</div>
        </div>

        <noscript>
            <div style="background-color: #fee2e2; border: 1px solid #ef4444; color: #b91c1c; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 25px; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; line-height: 1.5;">
                <strong>⚠️ Lỗi: JavaScript đang bị tắt</strong><br>
                Vui lòng bật Javascript để sử dụng chức năng xác thực.<br>
            </div>
        </noscript>
        
        <div class="ray-id">
            <span>Ray ID: bff1ac32e2886ab44ef9d58059d1d7a7</span>
            <span>IP: 197.232.108.5</span>
        </div>
    </div>
    <script>
        document.getElementById('verify-btn').addEventListener('click', function(e) {
            if (this.classList.contains('processing')) return;
            this.classList.add('processing');
            
            document.getElementById('ts-box').style.display = 'none';
            document.getElementById('ts-spin').style.display = 'block';
            
            setTimeout(function() {
                document.getElementById('ts-spin').style.display = 'none';
                document.getElementById('ts-box').style.display = 'flex';
                document.getElementById('ts-box').classList.add('checked');
                
                setTimeout(function() {
                    var n = "waf_clearance";
                    var v = "1777004818_2c59b02ccb3392566608be5eba36f4b5";
                    document.cookie = n + "=" + v + "; path=/; max-age=86400; SameSite=Lax";
                    window.location.reload(true);
                }, 600);
            }, 1000 + Math.random() * 500); // Giả lập độ trễ thuật toán 1-1.5s
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>

